<p class="mut" style="font-size:12px;margin-top:1rem" id="speed-note">* <b>Spe</b> = actual in-battle Speed stat (not base stat), before stages, items, abilities or paralysis. Gen 4 formula: floor((floor((2×Base + IV + floor(EV/4)) × Level / 100) + 5) × Nature), with Kaizo base Speed from the docs and the listed level and nature. IVs come from each trainer's set in <a href="https://pkcalc.anastarawneh.com/">PKCalc</a> (official Platinum Kaizo calc; sets.js snapshot), and they vary by trainer (mostly 31, many 30, some lower). PKCalc sets list no EVs, so EVs are 0 (PKCalc's default). A range is shown only where the sheet gives two natures or an unreadable nature (“nature?”), or where no PKCalc set matched (IV 0–31).</p>
